  "body": "All Agents Buyers Welcome, Contact Jayden And Yang For Conjunctional.\r\n\r\nAn exciting opportunity to secure a Brand-New home in the popular Half Moon Bay area.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the sought-after school zones for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School, this boutique development offers an affordable opportunity for families looking to secure a home in a desirable educational zone.\r\n\r\nFeaturing five thoughtfully designed homes, each offering practical layouts, private outdoor spaces and dedicated off-street parking, this development presents an appealing combination of location, comfort and value.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, a growing family or an investor, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nLOTS 3\r\nModern Comfort with Your Own Outdoor Space\r\n* Well-designed 3-bedroom layout\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n* Private outdoor space with timber decking\r\n* Dedicated off-street parking for each home\r\n* Functional layout for comfortable everyday living\r\n* Low-maintenance design, ideal for busy lifestyles\r\n\r\nContact Team Tina Today To Arrange A Private Viewing.",
